{"unit_id":"mhlywxl__dsh-coding-sound#card-zh","repo":"mhlywxl/dsh-coding-sound","commit":"0bd171d3cc84de812dbdbf640fb2c901eaf18552","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-coding-sound 是面向 DSH Web 会话的声音插件，会在设置页提供声音与提醒控制。它根据思考和回答文本的实际增量合成背景音乐，并为每个运行会话维护独立声部。主要功能包括多种音乐预设、生成完成和等待操作提示音、思考/回答/工具阶段的声音开关与音高频率调整，以及当前和后台会话的独立音量。适合希望不盯着屏幕也能感知 DSH 会话进度的用户。声音在浏览器中由 Web Audio 生成，偏好设置保存在本地浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:664-731","src/sessions.js:294-309","src/settings.js:17-20"]}
{"unit_id":"mhlywxl__dsh-coding-sound#card-en","repo":"mhlywxl/dsh-coding-sound","commit":"0bd171d3cc84de812dbdbf640fb2c901eaf18552","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-coding-sound adds audio to DSH Web. It generates music from streamed text and chimes when sessions finish or await input. Users can tune thinking, answer and tool sounds, choose presets, and set separate volumes for current and background sessions. Preferences stay in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:664-731","src/sessions.js:294-309","src/settings.js:17-20"]}
